url: https://readmes.pages.dev/email/help
license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-10
abstract: >
  privacy-email-profile-image renders an email address for GitHub profile
  READMEs as pixels inside an SVG, so the page source contains no address
  text for scrapers to harvest. It follows a "swap as it leaks" model: the
  owner keeps a list of alias addresses and switches the visible one with a
  secret link when an address starts attracting spam, and every embed
  updates at once. It runs on Cloudflare Pages Functions without dependencies.
keywords:
  - email
  - privacy
  - anti-spam
  - email-alias
  - disposable-email
  - github-profile-readme
  - svg
  - cloudflare-pages
